% V: fields with words but no clef, such as name= or sname=.
% parsevoice() (parseabc.c) compared the name of the clef with "tab"
% when the field had none, a read of uninitialised memory that the
% valgrind preset reports for abc2midi, abc2abc, yaps and abcmatch.
X:1
T:Voices without a clef
C:abc2midi test
M:4/4
L:1/4
K:C
V:1 name="Melody" sname="M"
C D E F |G A B c |]
V:2 name="Bass"
C, D, E, F, |G, A, B, C |]
